  "prefLabel": "Site 102.46 Sequential observation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Site 102.46 “Sequential observation” means a viewer is capable of seeing multiple energy facilities from different viewpoints as the viewer travels along a particular route such as a trail, river, scenic byway, or on a lake.\n\nSource. #10993, eff 12-16-15",
